---
title: Egg Sandwich
course: breakfast
servings: 1
time_active: 10
time_total: 10
tags: [quick, wfh-lunch]
description: Over-easy eggs with melted cheese on toasted sourdough, finished with hot sauce.
---

Toast @sourdough{2%slices} until golden.

Melt @butter{1%tbsp} in a #nonstick skillet{} over medium. Crack in @eggs{2} and season with @salt and @black pepper{}. Cook until the whites are set, ~{2-3%minutes}, then flip and cook ~{30%seconds} more.

Lay a slice of @cheese{1%slice} over the eggs, cover the pan, and cook until the cheese melts, ~{30%seconds}.

Slide the eggs onto one slice of toast, top with @hot sauce{}, and close the sandwich.
